> (-7 = .) (-8 = .) (-9 = .) (1 = 4) (2 = 3) (3 = 2) (4 = 1)
(158,452 changes made to plh0007)

. 
. 
. * ============================
. * ANALYSIS
. * ============================
.         
.         **The DiD is based on repeated observations before and after the trea
> tment (birth of a daughter).
.         **Since we use fixed effects, we exclude variables that are (nearly) 
> time-invariant, such as gender, education, religiosity, partnership status, b
> irthplace (born in Germany), and number of children.
.         
.         xtset pid syear

Panel variable: pid (unbalanced)
 Time variable: syear, 2000 to 2020, but with gaps
